Description: USB controller for the Tone Master Pro: leveling, block copy, song/setlist editing.
 Desktop companion for the Fender Tone Master Pro: search and inventory your preset library, bulk-edit parameters/blocks/IRs/footswitches, manage songs and setlists, and auto-level loudness to a LUFS target over USB. Full-preset edits round-trip through the offline .preset codec; live edits and leveling drive the device directly in re-amp mode.

